{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：经certutil发起网络连接。对应需求：命令控制。官方：Network Connection via Certutil。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.network-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：经certutil发起网络连接","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：经certutil发起网络连接\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远控通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv4-special-registry/iana-ipv4-special-registry.xhtml","https://frsecure.com/malware-incident-response-playbook/"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"3838e0e3-1850-4850-a411-2e8c5ba40ba8","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"network where host.os.type == \"windows\" and process.name : \"certutil.exe\" and\n  not cidrmatch(destination.ip, \"10.0.0.0/8\", \"127.0.0.0/8\", \"169.254.0.0/16\", \"172.16.0.0/12\", \"192.0.0.0/24\",\n                                \"192.0.0.0/29\", \"192.0.0.8/32\", \"192.0.0.9/32\", \"192.0.0.10/32\", \"192.0.0.170/32\",\n                                \"192.0.0.171/32\", \"192.0.2.0/24\", \"192.31.196.0/24\", \"192.52.193.0/24\",\n                                \"192.168.0.0/16\", \"192.88.99.0/24\", \"224.0.0.0/4\", \"100.64.0.0/10\", \"192.175.48.0/24\",\n                                \"198.18.0.0/15\", \"198.51.100.0/24\", \"203.0.113.0/24\", \"240.0.0.0/4\", \"::1\",\n                                \"FE80::/10\", \"FF00::/8\") and\n  not dns.question.name in (\"localhost\", \"*.digicert.com\", \"ctldl.windowsupdate.com\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1105","name":"Ingress Tool Transfer","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":220,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
